WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.961
Watch and read: For your copywords practice, you copy the object word “ball”. Which

00:00:04.961 --> 00:00:05.981
spelling is correct?

00:00:06.783 --> 00:00:09.621
The answer is: ball. Copy each letter in order.

00:00:10.783 --> 00:00:15.809
Watch and read: For your case practice, which spelling correctly writes the name of a

00:00:15.809 --> 00:00:16.479
person: ama?

00:00:17.283 --> 00:00:21.422
The answer is: Ama. Names of people begin with capital letters.
